---
manual: manip.clear.stops_timers
lines: [2327, 2329]
testability: api
display: native
ledger: B7
expect: fail
reason: "Lacci keeps a slot's timers through clear since 27 Sep, as Shoes 3 does (s3_canvas.c:781) and ten examples need; the manual says clear stops them. Waiting on Q8 (ledger B7)"
----------- app code
$ticks = 0
Shoes.app do
  @slot = stack do
    para "ticking"
    every(0.1) { $ticks += 1 }
  end
end
----------- test code
advance 0.55
assert_operator $ticks, :>, 0, "the timer runs while its slot is alive"

stack("@slot").clear
after_clear = $ticks
advance 0.55
assert_equal after_clear, $ticks, "clearing the slot stopped the timer inside it"
